    {
      "id": "encoding-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 282,
      "y": 1228.5,
      "width": 1116,
      "height": 53,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1905613549,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 696044926,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Encoding contract (keyspace diff in RB-10 compares both fleets): queue / currentClimbQueueItem are JSON.stringify of client objects (insertion order, undefined dropped);\nnull item = empty string · nullable scalars → '' · booleans '1' / '0' · epoch-ms strings · UNSET_SENTINEL tri-state in connection / participant hashes.\nEvery queue delta carries the post-event stateHash / stateHashOrdered (FNV-1a over UUID order, byte-for-byte).",
      "originalText": "Encoding contract (keyspace diff in RB-10 compares both fleets): queue / currentClimbQueueItem are JSON.stringify of client objects (insertion order, undefined dropped);\nnull item = empty string · nullable scalars → '' · booleans '1' / '0' · epoch-ms strings · UNSET_SENTINEL tri-state in connection / participant hashes.\nEvery queue delta carries the post-event stateHash / stateHashOrdered (FNV-1a over UUID order, byte-for-byte).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "encoding",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
